    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasia omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 8:25-29; 9:21-28)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Yerusalemu bakabeeka Ahasia, omwana omomura omoke o Yehoramu, akaba omorwoti ase ribaga riaye, ekiagera ekeombe ki’abaanto bachete amo n’Abaarabu ase egetwori konya baitire abamura abanene bonsi ba Yehoramu. Ase igo Ahasia, omomura o Yehoramu, akaba omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasia nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo ebere na ebere, ekero achagete kogamba, na akagamba omwaka oyomo, agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Atalia, omochokoro bw’Omuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere boigo akabwatia chinchera chi’enyomba y’Ahabu, ekiagera ng’ina nere orenge komosemia akore ayare amabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene, buna abanto b’enyomba y’Ahabu bakorete, ekiagera ekero ise akwete, abanto abwo bakaba abasemia baye, goika agaikera ogosirigwa kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaigwera ogosemigwa kwabo, akagenda amo na Yoramu, mosinto bw’Ahabu, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, korwania Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, agwo Ramoti o Gileadi. Abasiiria bagaaka Yoramu chingoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairana Yesireeli gochia kobwenigwa chingoma chiria anyorete agwo Rama, ekero arwanete na Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria. Ahasia, mosinto o Yehoramu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akagenda korora Yoramu, mosinto bw’Ahabu, agwo Yesireeli, ekiagera nigo arenge omorwaire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana aya nigo achigetwe na Nyasae ng’a okogwa kw’Ahasia kobe ase okogenda kwaye korora Yoramu. Ekero Ahasia aigete aroro, nigo agendete amo na Yoramu koumerana na Yehu, mosinto o Nimusi, ori’Omonene aagete amaguta, erinde asirie enyomba y’Ahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yehu arenge korua egesusuro igoro ase enyomba y’Ahabu, akanyora abanene b’Abayuda, na abana abamura b’abamura bamwabo Ahasia, baria barenge gokorera Ahasia, akabaita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarigia Ahasia. Nere akanyorekana bw’ebisete agwo Samaria, akarentwa ase Yehu, erio agaitwa. Abanto bakamotindeka, ekiagera nigo bateebete, “Oyio nigo arenge omochokoro o Yehosafati, oria omorigetie Omonene nenkoro yaye yonsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio omonto tarenge ase enyomba y’Ahasia oyo onyarete kogamba ase oborwoti boria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atalia eting’ana y’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 11:1)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Atalia, ng’ina Ahasia, aroche ng’a omwana oye okuure, akaimoka, agaita ab’enyomba yonsi y’omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yehoseba, mosubati o Yehoramu omorwoti, akarusia Yoashi, omwana bw’Ahasia, bobisi, korwa ase egati y’abana b’omorwoti, abwo barenge ang’e goitwa, akamoira amo nomoreri oye, akamobisa ase akanyomba gakorarwa. Aroro Yehoseba, mosubati o Yehoramu omorwoti, oyorenge moka Yehoyada Omokuani, akabisa Yoashi korwa ase Atalia, erinde tamoita. Ayio nigo ayakorete, ekiagera arenge omosubati omwabo Ahasia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi akaba amo nabarabwo ase emiaka etano nomo, abisire ase enyomba ya Nyasae, ekero Atalia arenge kogamba igoro ase ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
